          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 89505,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu, konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entrance_codes = {\" /><text value=\"2929\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(entrance_codes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{2929, 1101, 1134}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{2929, 1101, 1134}</code> kümesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[2929, 1101, 1134]</code> listesi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>entrance_codes</code> değişken adı</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{2929, 1101, 1134}</code> kümesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>entrance_codes</code> oluşturulurken bir <code>1101</code> daha eklenirse set kaç farklı değer depolar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entrance_codes = {\" /><text value=\"2929\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(entrance_codes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{2929, 1101, 1134}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Üç, çünkü set <code>1101</code> değerini yalnızca bir kez depolar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dört, çünkü setler yinelenen değerleri tutar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İki, çünkü yinelenen değer eklemek iki kopyayı da kaldırır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Üç, çünkü set <code>1101</code> değerini yalnızca bir kez depolar.</p></body></html>"
