          {
            "title": "Question: Avoid errors",
            "id": 89855,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu, konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"iris_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;setosa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;siberian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;aphylla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"iris_species.remove(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pumila&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(iris_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"KeyError: 'pumila'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"pumila\"</code> kümede bulunmadığı için bir hata</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{'setosa', 'siberian', aphylla'}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"pumila\"</code> kümede bulunmadığı için bir hata.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>remove(\"pumila\")</code> yerine <code>remove(\"setosa\")</code> yazdığını varsay. Son yazdırma işlemi ne gösterir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"iris_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;setosa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;siberian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;aphylla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"iris_species.remove(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pumila&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(iris_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"KeyError: 'pumila'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{\"siberian\", \"aphylla\"}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir KeyError, çünkü remove() her zaman hata verir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"setosa\"}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"siberian\", \"aphylla\"}</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Add a new element",
            "id": 89834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pine_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pine_species.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slash pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(pine_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'slash pine', 'sugar pine'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>pine_species</code> kümesine <code>\"slash pine\"</code> değerini ekler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"slash pine\"</code> değerini <code>pine_species</code> kümesinin <code>0</code> dizinine ekler</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey yapmaz, çünkü kod doğru değil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>pine_species</code> kümesine <code>\"slash pine\"</code> değerini ekler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod çalıştıktan sonra <code>pine_species.add(\"sugar pine\")</code> bir kez daha çalışır. Sette kaç değer olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pine_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pine_species.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slash pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(pine_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'slash pine', 'sugar pine'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İki, çünkü mevcut bir değeri eklemek yinelenen değer oluşturmaz</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Üç, çünkü <code>add()</code> başka bir kopya depolar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir, çünkü yinelenen değer eklemek yeni değeri kaldırır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İki, çünkü mevcut bir değeri eklemek yinelenen değer oluşturmaz.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No duplicates",
            "id": 89833,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Safari\"</code> değeri eklendikten sonra <code>installed</code> kümesinde kaç değer olacak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"installed = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chrome&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Firefox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"installed.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(installed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'Firefox', 'Safari', 'Chrome'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Üç değer</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İki değer</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dört değer</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Üç değer.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>add(\"Safari\")</code> yerine <code>add(\"Edge\")</code> yazdığını varsay. <code>installed</code> kaç değer içerir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"installed = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chrome&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Firefox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"installed.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(installed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'Firefox', 'Safari', 'Chrome'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dört, çünkü Edge yeni bir değerdir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Üç, çünkü bir kümeye ekleme yapmak kümenin boyutunu asla değiştirmez.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir, çünkü add() tüm kümenin yerini alır.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dört, çünkü Edge yeni bir değerdir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
